00:03:20.610 --> 00:03:23.160
Kind of like if I were
making out with myself,

00:03:23.160 --> 00:03:26.307
and I thought yeah, Nicki
should French kiss Nick.

00:03:26.307 --> 00:03:28.800
And, so that's where that came from.

00:03:28.800 --> 00:03:29.880
- [Kelly] Me on my couch.

00:03:29.880 --> 00:03:31.260
I was like, what?

00:03:31.260 --> 00:03:34.260
I literally, I died laughing,

00:03:34.260 --> 00:03:36.274
cause then your reaction after is --

00:03:36.274 --> 00:03:38.320
- Right.
- Brilliant. (laughs)

00:03:38.320 --> 00:03:39.599
- Nick Cage smooches good!

00:03:39.599 --> 00:03:40.432
You tell 'em.

00:03:40.432 --> 00:03:41.441
- [Kelly] You tell everyone.

00:03:41.441 --> 00:03:42.274
(all laughing)

00:03:42.274 --> 00:03:43.230
It's amazing (laughs)

00:03:43.230 --> 00:03:44.497
Nick Cage, everybody!

00:03:44.497 --> 00:03:45.330
